    "z0": 15980,
    "x1": 26180,
    "z1": 17340
   },
   "text": "A hard hat, floating out there. And dead fish, belly up.\nSomething's wrong with the water too."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 4250,
    "z0": 6120,
    "x1": 5950,
    "z1": 9520
   },
   "text": "The water wheel. It drives the mill through that shaft.\nIt turns when the sluice lets the water down the race."
  },
